♪ 'cause you're amazing ♪

543
00:21:12,870 --> 00:21:14,185
♪ just... ♪

544
00:21:15,169 --> 00:21:16,366
You know, if you
kiss me right now,

545
00:21:16,477 --> 00:21:18,243
I wouldn't have to
keep singing.

546
